<title>THAILAND: ICC InternatioNal Q1 net profit plunges.</title>
<headline>ICC InternatioNal Q1 net profit plunges.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>		    (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				  1997			  1996</p>
